    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reverse Immortal &quot;is a 3D action role-playing game with the theme of cultivating immortals. Players are immersed in the fantasy world of cultivation, playing the role of a mortal who has just entered the cultivation world. In order to attain enlightenment and become immortal, they need to constantly collect various genius treasures, experience monster fighting, and elevate their cultivation to a higher level. While improving their cultivation, they also encounter various people, demons, and monsters. In order to protect the human race, we have to walk among the three realms to resist various evil forces and safeguard the peace of the world.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802380/extras/93cd37c21643b76a563e30f132b22f33.avif?t=1754587253\" data-has-big width=800 height=438 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802380/extras/5b3dc2f4524906e8050be822aa7e0b41.avif?t=1754587253\" data-has-big width=800 height=438 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802380/extras/b3d5194bdaf11fa44d043f10eed999e9.avif?t=1754587253\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802380/extras/712cf757ce435abb4b40793a5491ae92.avif?t=1754587253\" data-has-big width=800 height=438 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802380/extras/e5b13f92127ee57063d68c42a0aaf662.avif?t=1754587253\" data-has-big width=800 height=438 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802380/ex